  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/656/656-7-a.htm",
  "statuteText": "656:7-a Order of Representative Districts. –\n\nIn places which are electing representatives to the general court from more than one district, the order of officers on the ballot for that place shall list the candidates for representative to the general court in the numerical order of the districts from which they are running with the lower numbered district being listed first."
